---
import Layout from '../../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="F1 Fandom Wiki"
	description="Administration, content management, and template engineering for one of the largest online Formula 1 wikis."
>
	<p>
		The <strong>Formula 1 Wiki</strong> on Fandom is a comprehensive community-driven encyclopedia documenting F1 history, statistics, results, and profiles. As an administrator and technical contributor, I oversee day-to-day community operations, enforce guidelines, and architect the site's template infrastructure to display complex stats in clean, responsive tables.
	</p>

	<h2>Wiki Contributions</h2>

	<div class="specs-grid">
		<div class="spec-card">
			<div class="spec-header">
				<span class="spec-icon">
					<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
				</span>
				<h3>Role & Community</h3>
			</div>
			<table class="spec-table">
				<tbody>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Position</td><td>Administrator & Sysop</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Responsibilities</td><td>Content management, moderation, user coordination</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Scope</td><td>Formula 1, GP results, Driver profiles</td></tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>

		<div class="spec-card">
			<div class="spec-header">
				<span class="spec-icon">
					<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg>
				</span>
				<h3>Technical Stack</h3>
			</div>
			<table class="spec-table">
				<tbody>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Wiki Engine</td><td>MediaWiki</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Scripting</td><td>Lua (MediaWiki Scribunto modules)</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Styling</td><td>Vanilla CSS (Custom layouts & tables)</td></tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="lab-note">
		<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg>
		<span>
			<strong>Scribunto Lua Scripting:</strong> In MediaWiki, complex calculators (such as championship point standings or constructor grids) are built in Lua to parse input strings dynamically and render structured wikitext.
		</span>
	</div>

	<h2>Key Responsibilities</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Content Curation & Enforcement</strong> — Defining writing standards, reviewing edits, and maintaining historical Grand Prix accuracy.</li>
		<li><strong>Template Engineering</strong> — Creating reusable wikitext templates to handle repetitive data tables (e.g. driver career records, qualification timing grids).</li>
		<li><strong>Visual Styling</strong> — Writing global CSS overrides on Fandom to modernize table designs, improve dark-mode visibility, and adapt layouts for mobile devices.</li>
		<li><strong>API Bot Coordination</strong> — Designing guidelines for automated script bots (such as the F1 Wiki Automator) to deploy statistics updates without disrupting regular editor flows.</li>
	</ul>

	<div class="tech-tags">
		<span class="tag">MediaWiki</span>
		<span class="tag">Lua</span>
		<span class="tag">CSS</span>
		<span class="tag">Community Administration</span>
		<span class="tag">Content Strategy</span>
	</div>

	<div class="back-link-wrapper">
		<a href="/portfolio" class="back-link">← Back to Portfolio</a>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.specs-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
		gap: 1.25rem;
		margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
	}

	.spec-card {
		padding: 1.25rem;
		background: rgba(30, 35, 50, 0.5);
		backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
		border: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.12);
		border-radius: 10px;
		transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
	}

	.spec-card:hover {
		border-color: rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.3);
	}

	.spec-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.spec-icon {
		color: var(--accent);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.spec-header h3 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: rgb(var(--black));
	}

	.spec-table {
		width: 100%;
		border-collapse: collapse;
	}

	.spec-table td {
		padding: 0.4rem 0;
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.08);
	}

	.spec-table tr:last-child td {
		border-bottom: none;
	}

	.spec-label {
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		font-weight: 600;
		width: 5rem;
	}

	.lab-note {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 0.8rem;
		padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
		background: rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.08);
		border: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.15);
		border-radius: 8px;
		margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.lab-note svg {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		color: var(--accent);
		margin-top: 0.15rem;
	}

	.tech-tags {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		margin: 2rem 0;
	}

	.tag {
		padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
		background: rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.12);
		border: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.2);
		border-radius: 4px;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.back-link-wrapper {
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
		padding-top: 1.5rem;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--gray-light), 0.3);
	}

	.back-link {
		color: var(--accent);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
	}

	.back-link:hover {
		opacity: 0.8;
	}

	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.specs-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
